# CVE-2026-59873: node-tar gzip-bomb DoS in the npm bundled inside the
# GitHub Actions runner (externals/node20 and node24 copies). tar is fixed
# in 7.5.19, but no runner release ships it yet, and the files are the
# runner's own bundle, not something this Dockerfile installs or can
# upgrade. DoS only, and the runner never npm-installs untrusted archives
# on the plan/apply path. Added 2026-08-20 at runner 2.336.0; re-check on
# every GH_RUNNER_VERSION bump and drop this entry when the bundled npm
# carries tar >= 7.5.19.
CVE-2026-59873
